  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "A beautiful red cloud flies toward green ghost desert while she lies on it. She is named a seductive rank seven female Gu Immortal who once roamed Western Desert as a demoness, trifled with a righteous path rank eight, and was saved by Thousand Transformations Ancestor, becoming one of his concubines. She is not his type, so her status stays lower than Fairy Cui Bo’s even though she is beautiful and sexy. She and Fairy Cui Bo compete fiercely in secret, yet with his will supervising her she must use her fastest method to save Fairy Cui Bo.",
      "chapters": [
        1412
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "reg_western_desert",
        "char_thousand_transformations_ancestor",
        "char_fairy_cui_bo"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "She has a curvy body and wears a red dancing dress with yellow threads, belly, arms, and legs exposed. Golden jade bracelets sit on her wrists and ankles. Many jeweled rings on her fingers are blue, green, and red. Her eyes have a deep gaze, her brows are thick and long, and a faint green light is in her eyes even when half closed. A translucent red veil covers half her face, leaving tall nose and red lips behind the veil.",
      "chapters": [
        1412
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Her signature method is immortal killer move Dancing Red Cloud, soft like cotton and bouncy under her. She rides it into green ghost desert under dark clouds, then sits cross-legged and opens her eyes in vigilance. She advances only along a corner of that danger zone because she carries Thousand Transformations Ancestor’s will and rank eight Immortal Gu. When an ancient soul beast pounces, the will tells her to advance while the Immortal Gu stops the beast’s attack.",
      "chapters": [
        1412
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "desert-beast-encounter",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "move_dancing_red_cloud",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    }
  ],
